# Guidelight Matrix: "{2}, {T}: Target Mount you control becomes saddled until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery."
# Turn 1 Bot1 casts Matrix with Sol Ring's {C}{C} (the enters trigger draws Memnite) and a Smuggler's Copter, a Vehicle
# that is not a Mount. Bot2's turn 2 puts a Caustic Bronco, a Mount, on its side. On turn 3 Bot1's own Caustic Bronco is
# saddled for {2} (CR 702.171b): the opponent's Bronco, Bot1's Copter and Bot1's Memnite are refused as targets. With
# Bot1's own Memnite still on the stack the ability is refused (sorcery speed, CR 602.5d), though the Matrix is untapped
# and Sol Ring unspent. The saddling ends with the turn: on turn 5 the Bronco is no longer saddled.

